# Added here: The Monogrammed Sash (8552).
# The hearth is set in Ironforge on the training stop: the Searing Gorge guide starts with it (and the gryphon to
# Thelsamar), and the Burning Steppes guide hearths back there twice.

step The Altar of Zul
  when onquest 2989
  tip Ride south-east to the Altar of Zul, the stepped Vilebranch temple in the south of the Hinterlands, and climb to the top. Qiaga and Morta'gya the Keeper (elite, 50) stand up there: touch the top and come straight back down.
  tip Careful: Elite trolls guard the top platform, including Qiaga the Keeper and Morta'gya the Keeper, along with several Vilebranch Soothsayers. The soothsayers cast spells and are linked to the rest of the group.
  goto 49.0,68.7
  complete 2989 @49.0,68.7

step Skulk Rock
  tip Ride north to Skulk Rock in the middle of the Hinterlands. Green Sludges and Jade Oozes crawl all around it.
  tip Careful: Panthers move around the area in stealth.
  kill 2655 quest 2877                -- Green Sludge
  kill 2656 quest 2877                -- Jade Ooze

step Wildkin feathers
  zone The Hinterlands
  tip Erelas Ambersky's Wildkin Feathers lie on the ground across the Hinterlands, south and east of Aerie Peak, where the owlbeasts roam: pick them up as you ride between the altar and Skulk Rock.
  collect 10819 quest 3661                    -- Wildkin Feather

step Aerie Peak
  turnin 2881 direct optional -- Inside
  turnin 2877                         -- Fraggar Thundermantle
  turnin 2989                         -- Gryphon Master Talonaxe, inside
  accept 2990                         -- for Thadius Grimshade at Nethergarde Keep, later

