step The Bloodsail captains
  zone Stranglethorn Vale
  tip The three Bloodsail ships lie at anchor off the coast just south of Booty Bay: Captain Stillwater (45) and Captain Keelhaul (46) on the nearer decks, Fleet Master Firallon (48) on the flagship, each with a crew of 42-45 pirates. Swim out, clear each deck from the edge and pull one at a time.
  kill 2550 quest 608.1 @32.9,88.2 map 1434 -- Captain Stillwater
  kill 2548 quest 608.2 @29.3,88.3 map 1434 -- Captain Keelhaul
  kill 2546 quest 608.3 @30.6,90.6 map 1434 -- Fleet Master Firallon

step Booty Bay
  turnin 608                          -- Fleet Master Seahorn, top floor

